WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.720
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.630
Pass through boundaries of life and death, stride over the peak of the sky

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:28.830
Look at this dim dark sky from the distance

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.960
Glowing tears on fair skin

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:44.700
Melt this dark night

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.500
Souls entwine both on watch

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:55.230
Protect the candle-like warmth

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:00.560
Under the night sky sunflowers are swaying in the wind

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.160
As the night will always pass by

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:08.030
Let's embrace the new dawn

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.760
Fleeting Meteor

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.160
Broke the silence of the sky

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:19.500
Call for new heroes with my remaining brightness

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.030
Burn out the flame of life in the wind

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:24.360
Penetrate the endless horizon

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.700
Cross over the long night to another end

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.760
Search for that destination

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.430
Fly towards the other side of my dream

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.160
Episode 7

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.260
Ha-Ha~

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:51.060
I felt bad for not giving you a present for a long time.

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:58.800
Oh! It's Ru Yue again!

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:01.730
Ru Yue...

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:05.460
She looks like how i was before.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:07.800
Always alone.

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:16.400
Muzi

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:17.260
Mhm?

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:19.200
I want...

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:23.060
Just go!

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:24.530
Mmmm!

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:28.460
Ru Yue! Ru Yue!

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:29.860
'Ma Ying Xiong?'

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:31.660
What do you want?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.800
Let's be friends!

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.800
'Friends?'

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.930
Mm! There goes an old saying, 'Out of Blows Friendship Grows'.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:42.200
Besides, we even watched a movie together!

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:44.330
How stupid you are!

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.530
If you didn't get higher level on that day -

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.330
I would've killed the two of you!

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:49.930
I got close to you -

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:53.200
is because you have a powerful energy, and can..

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.460
protect me from danger....

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:58.130
No worries.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.460
I'll protect you.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.930
Did Li Muzi asked you to come here just to provoke me?!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:06.930
You misunderstood Muzi.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.260
I've been in Muzi’s spiritual world.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:13.600
I found that she is carrying the burden of her family's death.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.800
Living all alone in this cold and cruel world.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.330
She also feels lonely -

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:20.660
just like we do.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:21.730
Hmph!

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:25.000
I thought she's an arrogant, blustering wealthy woman.

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.030
She is not.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.400
She's only putting a strong front in front of others.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.200
Right now, I'm the only one that she can rely on.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:35.130
So, that's why you're desperately protecting her -

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:36.000
and you too.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.460
When you're in any danger, I will try my best to protect you too.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:41.460
Because we are friends!

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:43.600
Ma Ying Xiong..

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.730
Hey, don't comfort her too much.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.330
Or I'll get jealous.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:52.730
Muzi..

00:03:56.600 --> 00:04:00.000
( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.200
It's not appropriate to do here...

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.600
Don't worry~ Nobody will come~ (¬‿¬)

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.600
I want you so bad~

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.800
Darling~

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.930
Aaahh!..Ghost!!

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.860
You young brats...

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:21.930
Not only you are speaking lascivious words,

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.660
but even want to do dirty things.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.060
You brats are getting in the way of my cultivation!

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.400
It's you who are disturbing us!

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:31.530
Impudicity!
*Impudicity - lack of modesty

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:34.330
H-Help..me..

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.660
Aaah!!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.460
Bao! Please wake up! Bao!!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:42.800
Ah!

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:47.660
I didn't expect the breakthrough of my 'Fiend Art' will come so quickly...
*Fiend Art - some kind off evil or forbidden method for cultivation

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:52.200
The fruit called Ru Yue that I've been rearing for so many years...

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:54.730
is finally matured.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:05.730
I need to find a way or -

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.060
he will kill me for sure!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.260
Ru Yue!

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:10.930
Yes, Master.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:16.730
Did you finish the mission that I gave you?

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:18.400
Master..

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:22.260
I failed you, sorry for letting master down.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.530
Why?

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:27.530
That man got very powerful at that time so...

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.330
I couldn't defeat him.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.000
Fine

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.800
By absorbing blood from these bodies, once again...

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.730
i have reached an another breakthrough point.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.930
Ten days later, I can kill those two cultivators.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.400
As long as I, absorb their blood -

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:45.600
I'm sure i can reach the 'Late Stage of Core Formation'.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.970
Master, should i personally -

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:54.110
During this period of time, you hold them off!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.910
Do not let them to know my existence!

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.240
Yes, Master..

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:04.170
Go, I'm going to consume these bodies now.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:05.510
Yes..

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.370
If he really finish his Fiend Art,

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:13.970
not only them

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.040
even i will be killed.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:21.770
Ru Yue!

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.240
Ru Yue! Ru Yue!

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:27.440
Ru Yue!

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.370
Where did she go?

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:40.440
Ying Xiong..

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:41.840
Eh?

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.040
Ru Yue?

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:45.110
Eh?! Wait!!

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.570
You...

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.370
Why did you call me out in middle of the night?!

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:52.440
and why are you dress like that?

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:54.640
You don't like..

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.710
how I'm dressed?

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.710
No! No! I didn't say i don't like.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:00.840
Than -

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:02.440
How about this?!

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.440
N-N-N-N-NO!!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.110
Don't you want to see by body?

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:10.110
Ru Yue! You can't do this!

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.970
You wouldn't want me anyway, would you?

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:15.640
I'm sorry, but I can't betray Muzi!

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.370
Betray?

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.370
So what?

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.110
In this false world...

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.040
truth does not exit!

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:31.640
OH MY GOD!

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:36.240
Ru Yue! Please stop! Don't do this!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.570
Please hear me out!

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:41.570
Didn't you say that you'll protect me?!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.370
You can't even protect yourself!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.710
Where is your spirit energy?

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:57.040
Use you real spirit energy now -

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.710
or else I will,

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.240
Kill You!

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:06.640
If you don't do anything, you will die here!

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:10.770
I'll never fight with my friend!

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.510
You blockhead.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:18.110
Then die!

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:29.910
Why?..

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.570
Why?...

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.370
Why didn't you use your spirit energy?!

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.840
Do you want to die again one more time?! You Idiot!

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:41.440
Why didn't you fight back?!

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.370
Because, my spirit energy..

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:46.440
is meant for protecting you!

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:52.970
Ying Xiong..

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.570
Its alright now, Muzi!

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:59.710
You dare to cheat on your lover, you should be thanking me for not killing you~

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:03.370
Wha..lover? We were just...

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.240
Let's listen to your explanation!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.110
Even if I don't kill you,

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:09.170
My Master will kill both of you!

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.910
That's why we need your help, Ru Yue.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:16.310
Aren't you afraid? i might try to kill you again.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.440
You can try.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.710
I came here to tell you -

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:28.310
That my master felt the release of your spirit energy.

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:30.640
You've exposed yourselves!

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:33.310
So, your master sent you here

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.910
to test our power through fighting?

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:39.640
If we were kill by Ru Yue, It's our own fault.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:45.370
or if Ru Yue got killed by us, and then he can continue his own plan mysteriously.

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:51.240
But now we are all alive, and Ru Yue can't go back to her master's place.

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:54.970
Then Ru Yue...

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:59.770
I didn't expect the school's beauty queen IQ and appearance to be in reverse.

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:02.040
Sorry, to be in this state!~

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:07.310
So, Ru Yue's master is a real tough guy...

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.310
Not only that -

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.910
Master will reach the 'Middle Stage of Core Formation' soon.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.770
After that, he'll surely kill us.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.640
We are doomed!

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:26.840
My cultivation level is leveling so fast.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:31.170
Now i just need those two cultivators' blood,

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:34.240
and then ten year's of time for the cultivation can be saved.

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.970
The 'Middle Stage of Core Formation' is within my reach~

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.970
HaHaHaHaHaHa~

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:49.880
Waken at nightfall  It's the whisper of waves

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:55.610
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:10:56.940 --> 00:11:04.010
Scattered time   Blank mood

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:08.810
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:17.140
Wind is passed   Ear is listening

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:22.680
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:30.680
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:37.480
Pitter-patter is perpetual  Bit bit drops into my heart

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:44.480
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:49.610
It rejects of dying alone
